"https://steamcommunity.com/id/sambabal/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 127, "playtime_forever": 914, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 644, "last_played": 1787226573, "avatar": "f077b8e6ff76b94ea5ce96c3c2ed6c6dd9ecf856"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game shouldn't be as good as it is. It's messy, really yanky at times, feels born out of asset flips, looks terrible, feels uninspired, FU game design, no ultrawide support,  hard framecap, and yet I can't seem to put my mouse and keyboard down and play one more mission. I'm having that much fun within all the mayhem.\n No BS, just pick a class and go.\n\nHonestly though, devs really lucked out with this one. Probably why they keep remaking it with some slight changes here and there.", "timestamp_created": 1787207246, "timestamp_updated": 1787208725, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.544856846332550049", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32665", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 5700X3D 8-Core Processor           ", "adapter_description": "AMD Radeon RX 7900 XT", "vram_size": 20421}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232886371", "author": {"steamid": "76561198080099535", "personaname": "Batman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BennayBobby/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 2081, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 823, "last_played": 1789216492, "avatar": "21228275b3080fbd08eb7de40fa8ef7ad3098425"}, "language": "english", "review": "Kill Things, get loot. Kill more 10/10 game", "timestamp_created": 1786800086, "timestamp_updated": 1786800086, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 34, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "232648037", "author": {"steamid": "76561198044933836", "personaname": "Dearmanater", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198044933836/", "num_games_owned": 913, "num_reviews": 543, "playtime_forever": 1781, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1781, "deck_playtime_at_review": 1781, "last_played": 1786530257, "avatar": "e1c93d48f6a6483b730023dfe347bfc3165597d2"}, "language": "english", "review": "A great reboot of the EDF series. Only problem is the 110 levels, it outstayed its welcome after level 70ish", "timestamp_created": 1786532351, "timestamp_updated": 1786532351, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.533177733421325684", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232638460", "author": {"steamid": "76561199578742839", "personaname": "Filthy Wretch", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199578742839/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1745, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1222, "last_played": 1786699681, "avatar": "181025648d801aa9bce17fbd7479459df5fc242a"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun", "timestamp_created": 1786518887, "timestamp_updated": 1786518887, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.512195110321044922", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232526465", "author": {"steamid": "76561198207650015", "personaname": "ConnorKebab", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198207650015/", "num_games_owned": 243, "num_reviews": 59, "playtime_forever": 15, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15, "last_played": 1786388534, "avatar": "68e71f9fc11d2dd9ad516b3080f9323a1d4682f9"}, "language": "english", "review": "0/10\n\nGenuinely the most buns garbage I have ever had the unfortunate opportunity to play, if we can call it play.\n\nMenus are horrific to look at, even worse to use. No tutorial. No info. Nothing. \n\nMundane and dull combat, terrible graphics, 60fps cap. There is nothing at all to praise the game for.\n\nWhy does it have such a cult following, when the devs pump out absolute slop?\n\nHope you all enjoyed my review, please feel free to leave a slightly passive aggressive comment.\n\nThanks,\nMr Kebab", "timestamp_created": 1786388863, "timestamp_updated": 1786388863, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 5, "weighted_vote_score": "0.37099120020866394", "comment_count": 8, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "hardware": {"system_ram": "31904", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 9 7900X 12-Core Processor            ", "adapter_description": "AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT", "vram_size": 16200}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232474778", "author": {"steamid": "76561197995647404", "personaname": "RenegadeFerret", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RenegadeFerret/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 4899, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4774, "last_played": 1788752058, "avatar": "da0930f372595f1ccae557045e466c03d40bcee8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Why do we love EDF5?  Because it's a game about FUN.  When you encounter your first giant bugs, you will pull the trigger to your assault rifle and realize \"this feels good\".  And yes, it does!  After your first couple missions you will unlock new weapons.  You figure, these must be fun too!   But no, some of them suck!  But that is the glory of the game design, the game will give you hundreds of weapons, all of them unique.  Some will be wimpy, but those help the great ones stand out!\n\nThe games themselves feature over 100 levels, all which are fun.  Even after beating all of them, going back to the early stages are just as fun as the final ones.  As you play on higher difficulties, you unlock even more powerful weapons, then you can start the 100 levels over again if you so please.  There's over 80 hours of content on a single play through, and that's only with one character.\n\nVery few shooters have to offer what EDF5 has.  To beat the most challenging levels, you must experiment, plan, position, prioritize and execute:  Experiment by learning all your weapons, plan the proper loadout, position yourself to have the best line of sight or protection, prioritize the enemies to strike, and execute with focus.\n\nIf you would rather have a relaxing run through, go ahead and put it on an easier difficulty, no harm no foul.  EDF has something for everyone.  Except amazing graphics and sound...\n\nBut the lack of graphic and sound fidelity is intentional.  In order to have hundreds of enemies firing projectiles on the screen, the presentation has to give.  However, when you have a thousand bugs and lasers firing at you, you will feel overwhelmed by all the particle effects and simplified sound effects.  You KNOW you are up against an unbelievable force because the simple visuals and noises compile to a giant swarm headed your way.\n\nThis is my favorite game series and I can't recommend it enough.  See below for a quick summary ranking of all games in the series.\n\n[u][b]Mainline Games[/b][/u]\n\nA – Tier\nEDF 5\nEDF 6\n\nB – Tier\nEDF 4.1\n\n[u][b]Sideline EDF Games[/b][/u]\n\nB – Tier\nEDF World Brothers 2\n\nC – Tier \nEDF World Brothers (go straight to World Brothers 2 unless you are an EDF addict)\n\nD – Tier (Hell Divers 2 is what these games strived to be, play that first)\nEDF Insect Armageddon\nEDF Iron Rain\n\n[u][b]Offshoots and Old School[/b][/u]\n\nB – Tier\nAll mainline console games before EDF 4.1\n\nC – Tier\nEDF 4.1 Wingdiver the Shooter", "timestamp_created": 1786326636, "timestamp_updated": 1788744327, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.503311276435852051", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232367303", "author": {"steamid": "76561199224119376", "personaname": "Blur", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199224119376/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 2509, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2225, "last_played": 1786593531, "avatar": "edea68afd57a75255af47916521ba7b4bd0174c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "its a game that exists and i like the game that exists", "timestamp_created": 1786213642, "timestamp_updated": 1786213642, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.488372087478637695", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232303315", "author": {"steamid": "76561198357969616", "personaname": "cocaine-charli", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/8wigga/", "num_games_owned": 141, "num_reviews": 70, "p